<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-JOHNSON WINS WORLD 110 METRES HURDLES TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-JOHNSON WINS WORLD 110 METRES HURDLES TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Allen Johnson won the world 110 metres hurdles gold medal on Thursday.</p>
<p>Colin Jackson of Britain took the silver and Slovak Igor Kovac the bronze.</p>
</text>
